LOCAL turn 1 A: ```python\ndef count_vowels(text):\n    """\n    Returns the number of vowels (a, e, i, o, u) in the given text.\n\n    Args:\n        text: The string to check.\n\n    Returns:\n        The count of vowels in the string.\n    """\n    vowels = "aeiouAEIOU"\n    count = 0\n    for char in text:\n        if char in vowels:\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```
